{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a college student who has just moved to a large city in search of a new life. But instead of a fresh start, you begin to suffer from recurring nightmares. In your dreams, you see a mysterious hill. It\u2019s calling you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night the visions grow more vivid: underground tunnels, abandoned structures, and a strange device that once kept something contained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/0336388f48529cb07414ce4826a4b184.poster.avif?t=1773924636\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/0336388f48529cb07414ce4826a4b184.webm?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/0336388f48529cb07414ce4826a4b184.mp4?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to understand what\u2019s happening, you uncover classified documents hidden in the city archives. What you discover leaves you with only one choice \u2014 go to the hill yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to end the nightmares is to reach their source. But not everything buried underground should be awakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e019fb5548878dbd0acb8d5491478c07.poster.avif?t=1773924636\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e019fb5548878dbd0acb8d5491478c07.webm?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e019fb5548878dbd0acb8d5491478c07.mp4?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark atmospheric horror experience inspired by real locations. Explore the remains of an old fortress, labyrinthine tunnels, a shadowed forest, and ancient shrines hidden beneath the hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate your surroundings, piece together fragments of a buried truth, solve environmental puzzles, and navigate dangerous terrain with light parkour elements as you descend deeper into the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every discovery brings you closer to the truth \u2014 and to an ancient horror that has slept beneath the hill for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will lead to one of three different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is created by a former Lead Level Designer of a well-known Chernobyl-based project, with a strong focus on immersion, tension, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/80c4bde32e2b7ea6919becfd60418f39.poster.avif?t=1773924636\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/80c4bde32e2b7ea6919becfd60418f39.webm?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/80c4bde32e2b7ea6919becfd60418f39.mp4?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963490?t=1773924636","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963490?t=1773924636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/bbb74c469d5709371b8c8c72de65c6370be11da2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773924636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/bbb74c469d5709371b8c8c72de65c6370be11da2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773924636","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a college student who has just moved to a large city in search of a new life. But instead of a fresh start, you begin to suffer from recurring nightmares. In your dreams, you see a mysterious hill. It\u2019s calling you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night the visions grow more vivid: underground tunnels, abandoned structures, and a strange device that once kept something contained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/0336388f48529cb07414ce4826a4b184.poster.avif?t=1773924636\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/0336388f48529cb07414ce4826a4b184.webm?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/0336388f48529cb07414ce4826a4b184.mp4?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to understand what\u2019s happening, you uncover classified documents hidden in the city archives. What you discover leaves you with only one choice \u2014 go to the hill yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to end the nightmares is to reach their source. But not everything buried underground should be awakened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e019fb5548878dbd0acb8d5491478c07.poster.avif?t=1773924636\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e019fb5548878dbd0acb8d5491478c07.webm?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/e019fb5548878dbd0acb8d5491478c07.mp4?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark atmospheric horror experience inspired by real locations. Explore the remains of an old fortress, labyrinthine tunnels, a shadowed forest, and ancient shrines hidden beneath the hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate your surroundings, piece together fragments of a buried truth, solve environmental puzzles, and navigate dangerous terrain with light parkour elements as you descend deeper into the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every discovery brings you closer to the truth \u2014 and to an ancient horror that has slept beneath the hill for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions will lead to one of three different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is created by a former Lead Level Designer of a well-known Chernobyl-based project, with a strong focus on immersion, tension, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/80c4bde32e2b7ea6919becfd60418f39.poster.avif?t=1773924636\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/80c4bde32e2b7ea6919becfd60418f39.webm?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/extras/80c4bde32e2b7ea6919becfd60418f39.mp4?t=1773924636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["DENYS RUDYI GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963490/d2ef3c6456b0778adba5c865ea44ed49874eb017/header.jpg?t=1773924636","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963490/71264739/8320217034976a2f913a0d63b947c238e7b623a1/1772724198/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772725037","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963490/71264739/8320217034976a2f913a0d63b947c238e7b623a1/1772724198/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772725037","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963490/71264739/8320217034976a2f913a0d63b947c238e7b623a1/1772724198/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772725037","id":257297815,"name":"LYSA HORA Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257297815/802b17833656ade195ead5cb6c124d2c928974dc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=17727