eriments. With a strong focus on atmosphere, uncover a forbidden place inspired by a real location, through fortress tunnels, hidden laboratories, and ancient shrines.","steam_appid":3963490,"support_info":{"email":"ceo@denysrudyigames.com","url":"denysrudyigames.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":null}